@startuml
title Khách đặt đơn PayOS
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ParticipantBorderColor #222222
  ActorBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ActorBorderColor #222222
  BoundaryBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  BoundaryBorderColor #222222
  ControlBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ControlBorderColor #222222
  EntityBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  EntityBorderColor #222222
  LifeLineBorderColor #666666
  LifeLineBackgroundColor white
  MessageAlign center
}

actor Customer
boundary WebApp
control API
control OrderService
control PaymentService
entity PayOS
entity PostgreSQL

Customer->WebApp: Chọn PayOS và xác nhận đơn
WebApp->API: POST /orders with Idempotency-Key
API->OrderService: Validate request and customer JWT
OrderService->PostgreSQL: Check idempotency key and load prices
PostgreSQL-->OrderService: No existing order
OrderService->OrderService: Calculate final whole VND amount
OrderService->PostgreSQL: Create pending order and payment attempt
OrderService->PaymentService: Create checkout link
PaymentService->PayOS: Create payment link
PayOS-->PaymentService: Checkout URL and link ID
PaymentService->PostgreSQL: Save link and deadline
PaymentService-->OrderService: Checkout URL
OrderService-->API: Order and checkout URL
API-->WebApp: 201 pending unpaid
WebApp-->Customer: Chuyển sang trang PayOS
@enduml
